 & ={a}_{2}-{a}_{1} \\\\  & =18-6 \\\\  & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting these values into the formula for the sum of an arithmetic series, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}_{N} & =\\frac{N}{2}(2{a}_{1}+(N-1)d) \\\\ 216 & =\\frac{N}{2}(2\\cdot 6+(N-1)\\cdot 12) \\\\ 216 & =\\frac{N}{2}(12+12N-12) \\\\ 216 & =\\frac{N}{2}(12N) \\\\ 216 & =6{N}^{2} \\\\ 36 & ={N}^{2} \\\\ N & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that we take the positive square root because $N$can't be negative. Therefore, our series has $N=6$ terms." 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320187 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320188 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320189 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320190 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320191 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1041 "selection" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1104 #edb/ref 17592186320191 13194139534922 true] [17592186320186 1110 #uuid "31ec5ddf-6174-54c0-9545-03f099127179" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320187 1034 "12" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320187 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534922 true] [17592186320187 1111 #uuid "eb066679-3bd9-5b33-8365-2de38396c167" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320188 1034 "9" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320188 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534922 true] [17592186320188 1111 #uuid "f71db5de-4fd3-573b-a3a0-4480c987d878" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320189 1034 "10" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320189 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534922 true] [17592186320189 1111 #uuid "e1766094-c25c-501b-8204-e3696993bc9a" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320190 1034 "8" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320190 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534922 true] [17592186320190 1111 #uuid "a07e28dd-4d3a-5272-b96d-4b94d64a794b" 13194139534922 true] [17592186320191 1034 "6" 13194139534922 true] [175921